GUE1~ IN BORDER CAMPS: HELP

ORDERS: MOVE, ATTACK, HOLD, HIDE, RECRUIT.
STATUS SHOWS THE MAP; END HOLDS THE REST OF THIS TURN'S UNITS.
  MOVE <REGION>: AS FAR AS THE UNIT'S MOVE, NOT THROUGH THE ENEMY.
  ATTACK <REGION>: AN ENEMY IN RANGE.
  HOLD: STAY PUT.
  HIDE: GO TO GROUND (NO MOVE, NO ATTACK).
  RECRUIT: SPEND 3 SUPPORT ON A NEW CELL HERE.
RESULTS: NE NO EFFECT; AE THE ATTACKER LOSES A STEP; EX BOTH DO;
DR THE DEFENDER FALLS BACK (OR LOSES A STEP); DE THE DEFENDER LOSES A STEP.
GUE1~ IN BORDER CAMPS: RECRUIT

GUE2~ IN JUNGLE: HOLD

GUE3~ IN JUNGLE: HOLD

A NEW CELL FORMS AT BORDER CAMPS.
A SUPPLY DROP REACHES THE HILLS.
A PATROL FINDS GUE1.
A PATROL FINDS GUE2.
A PATROL FINDS GUE3.
A PATROL FINDS GUE4.
